DISCLAIMER (not a legal-code term, but binding on how you should read the output):
The ISV and IUC figures produced by this software are a MAINTAINED ESTIMATE of
Portuguese vehicle tax, cross-checked periodically against the official
Autoridade Tributária (AT) simulator and public tax tables. They are NOT the
official AT figure and do not replace the AT simulator or a licensed despachante.
Tax tables change; verify against the official source before relying on a number.
